1 NOTE <p>A Daniel McMackin owned plot 10 in the Doaghbeg Griffiths Valuation in 1854.<br />Kathleen Ward recalls that strip as being known as 'Owen's.</p> <p>Owen/John McMackin may and most likely was a son
2 CONC  of Daniels as there were no other McMackins in Doaghbeg.</p> <p>The current family (McConigleys) who own houses on this land are descendants of the McMackins, so it all adds up.&nbsp;</p>
