1 NOTE <p>Donal Friel</p><p><p>Notes for PRIONSIAS (ART OG) FRIEL:</p></p><p><p>Written evidence of Prionsias' existence is limited. There is a Francis Friel noted at holding 5b of Griffiths Primary Valuatio
2 CONC n for Arraherra in 1851. Given that the holding was shared with an Edward Junior (?? - son of Seamus Rua ??) and Hugh, the suggestion by Big Paddy that Art Og's farm was divided between the 3 sons app
2 CONC ears plausible. Francis does not appear on the 1834 Tithe Applotments.</p><p><p></p></p><p></p>
1 NOTE <p>GRiffith Eval 1855</p><p><p>shows 3 Friel brothers , Edward (jnr), Francis, Hugh, 5 a b and c one of whom must be the father of William. ( Una's G father)</p></p><p><p>Anne says 3 brothers lived si
2 CONC de by side and one of them owned the pub</p></p><p><p>Edward (jnr) also had plot of land 4 nearlighthouse, probably where coastguard is now.</p></p><p><p></p></p><p><p>One Edward snr  Friel show in 13
2 CONC c, ( Colls i 13a and b)</p></p><p>This maybe the father of the 3 brothers.</p>
