2 CONC  Presents shall come I, John Daily of Killeeshill in the parish of Killeeshill County of Tyrone in that part of the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland called Ireland, Farmer Sends Greetings -
2 CONC --  Whereas James McGough of Swedesburg, near the Borough of Norristown, Montgomery County State of Pennsylvania United States of America, lately deceased was the uncle of John Daily.  And Whereas the
2 CONC  said James McGough at Swedesburg aforesaid did intestate and without leaving issue leaving his widow only surviving him and he the said John Daily is the next of kin of the said James McGough decease
2 CONC d being the only surviving child of Owen Daily and Catherine Daily otherwise McGough, both of whom are deceased which said Catherine Daily otherwise McGough was the lawful sister of the said deceased 
2 CONC James McGough.  Now Know all Men by these Presents that the said John Daily do make ordain constitute and appoint John Daily Jr of the City of Philadelphia in the said State of Pennsylvania United Sta
2 CONC tes of America, workman, my true and lawful Attorney, for me and in my name, or in the name of him, my said Attorney to bring commence and prosecute all and proceeding action or suit at law and for me
