1 TITL United Kingdom, War Memorials, 1914-1949
1 PUBL MyHeritage
1 TEXT The records primarily consist of soldiers from the First and Second World Wars with a few records from different wars. The number of British casualties was smaller in wars following World War II, and 
2 CONC the number of records from other conflicts is consequently low. This collection content is copyright of the Imperial War Museums and the index is provided by MyHeritage free of charge as a beneficial 
2 CONC service to the genealogy community.
1 _TYPE Collection
1 _MEDI 10763
1 RIN MH:S500106
